# Third-party and generated sources are not project code. Without these
# overrides GitHub Linguist counts the vendored RNNoise C sources -- including
# the 78 MB generated weights blob in Sources/CRNNoise/src/rnnoise_data.c --
# and reports this repository as "C" instead of Swift.
#
# See https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/main/docs/overrides.md

# Vendored RNNoise (Mozilla/Jean-Marc Valin). Sources/CRNNoise/src/rnnoise_data.c
# holds the pretrained LPCNet weights as C float arrays and is ~99% of the
# repository's C bytes.
Sources/CRNNoise/** linguist-vendored

# Vendored Moonshine C API surface.
Sources/CMoonshine/** linguist-vendored

# Prebuilt Moonshine dylib.
Vendor/** linguist-vendored

# Vendored DeepFilterNet runtime binary and license files.
Sources/LumenAudio/Resources/DeepFilterNet/** linguist-vendored
